<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Service Restart Notification</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>This is a notification to inform you that the <strong>{{ serv_name }}</strong> service has been restarted or not on <strong>{{ inventory_hostname }}</strong>.</p>

    <table border="1" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
            <th>Service Name</th>
            <td>{{ serv_name }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Server</th>
            <td>{{ inventory_hostname }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Original State</th>
            <td>{{ org_state }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th>Current State</th>
            <td>{% if 'Service Not found' not in org_state %}restarted{% else %}Service was not Found , Please recheck the Name or is it installed..{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p>Please contact the IT department if you have any questions.</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>Your IT Team</p>
</body>
</html>
